## Jira Attachments

Use `jira-attach` to upload media to Jira tickets.

## Credential Access

Use `gopass` for authorized secrets and credentials. Run `gopass ls` to find an entry, but do not log or paste the listing. Pass values directly to the consuming command through standard input or a single-command environment; never inspect, print, log, paste, or persist them. Ask when the entry or authorization is unclear.
